<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n52511" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κᾰλαμ-ίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>,
			ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάλαμος</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>limed twig</i>, acc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ῖδα</span> (perh. metri gr.) <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				10.11
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Satyr.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>case for a writing-reed, pen-case</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				10.59
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>; <i>pen</i>(?), <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Po.</u>
				2.41
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>toothpick</i> or <i>toothbrush</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.70
			</span></i>; 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάλαμος</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				11.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Eup.</u>
				1.60
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Paul.Aeg.
				6.24
			</span></i>; also of <i>quills</i> used as <i>splints</i> for broken
			noses, ib.<i><span class="en">
				91
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάλαμος</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				11.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				5.96
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b> pl., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καλαμίδες</span> (sic <i><span class="en">
				<u>AB</u>
				269
			</span></i>), αἱ, <i>reeds put in layers</i>
			to strengthen buildings, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				11(2).144
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				<u>A</u>
				61
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				62
			</span></i> (Delos, <span class="entity">iv B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Inscr.Délos</u>
				366
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>A</u>
				36
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.1672.64
			</span></i>, cf. <u>AB</u>l.c.; also, <i>bundles</i>, ibid.
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>6.</b> at Cerynea, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καλαμαία</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
